
##Phase 2 Bringup: Hybrid pipeline launch + safety/health integration


## Summary

Added a per-robot hybrid pipeline launch with a launch_profile (sim/robot/debug).
Integrated fusion decision liveness into system health and SAFE_STOP behavior.
Extended cmd_vel safety to respect fusion risk_level and critical actions.    
 ## Key Changes

full_system.launch.py: added launch_profile and launched hybrid_pipeline.launch.py per robot.
response/launch/hybrid_pipeline.launch.py: new launch for sensor gateway + camera inference (real vs mock) + fusion decision.
health_monitor_node.py: fusion decision timeout → camera_sensor_timeout:<robot>.
mission_manager_node.py: SAFE_STOP when all robots timeout.
cmd_vel_safety_node.py: speed cap on high risk + passthrough for SUPPRESS/RESCUE.
Added tests: risk-level safety + hybrid failover + launch profile check.
